      {
        "id": 124579,
        "name": "arenson9",
        "username": "arenson9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-06T16:28:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Unity vs. The Ennead is similar to running Absolute Zero vs. Omnitron, you just plan the fight differently and accept you won't ever reach your big setups.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Would you please expound on how you play AZ differently vs. Omnitron? I assume you're talking about the fact that Omnitron can so easily destroy equipment and ongoing, as well as making Subzero Atmosphere dangerous.</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:58:38.017Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
