        "cooked": "<p>I thought of another problem she doesn’t solve: running out of HP pips while she and Captain Cosmic are both in play.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"AlexxKay\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> AlexxKay:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Another form of outside help that may be non-obvious: Unity can destroy <span class=\"bbcode-i\">any</span> piece of Equipment, not just ones that she owns.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>My favorite is destroying Ra’s staff so he can bust a new one out on his turn without having to waste an action.</p>",
